## Ecosystem

- [Wallets](https://www.bnbchain.org/en/wallets): Compatible wallets for storing and managing BNB and BEP-20 tokens
- [Bridge](https://www.bnbchain.org/en/bnb-chain-bridge): Cross-chain bridge for transferring assets between BNB Chain and other networks
- [Explore dApps](https://dappbay.bnbchain.org): Discover and explore dApps across DeFi, GameFi, NFTs, and more on BNB Chain
- [Staking](https://www.bnbchain.org/en/bnb-staking): Stake BNB to earn rewards and participate in securing the BNB Chain network
- [Greenfield Bridge](https://greenfield.bnbchain.org/en/bridge): Transfer BNB and tokens between BNB Smart Chain and BNB Greenfield network
- [opBNB Bridge](https://opbnb-bridge.bnbchain.org/deposit): Deposit and withdraw assets between BNB Smart Chain and opBNB Layer 2
- [DCellar](https://dcellar.io): Storage management console for BNB Greenfield with file upload, permission control, and cross-chain asset management

